{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30611","headline":"和主司王起 · 唐思言","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"儒雅皆传德敎行，几崇浮俗赞文明。\n龙门昔上波涛远，禁署同登渥泽荣。\n虚散谬当陪杞梓，後先宁异感生成。\n时方侧席徵贤急，况说謌谣近帝京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐思言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}